            "<p><strong>Role in Monsoon</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Importance</strong></p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>ITCZ</p>",
            "<p>Shifts north in summer pulling moist winds.</p>",
            "<p>Foundation concept</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Tibetan Plateau</p>",
            "<p>Intense heating creates strong low pressure.</p>",
            "<p>Frequently asked</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Subtropical Jet Stream</p>",
            "<p>Moves north allowing monsoon onset.</p>",
            "<p>Advanced concept</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Mascarene High</p>",
            "<p>High pressure pushes winds toward India.</p>",
            "<p>Rare but scoring</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
