      "level": 2,
      "content": "6. El Niño and La Niña"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "s0ta3jd",
      "content": "El Niño refers to abnormal warming of eastern Pacific waters, which weakens the Indian monsoon. La Niña represents cooling and usually strengthens the monsoon."
    },
